Package: koopman.dmd
Type: Package
Title: Koopman Operator and Dynamic Mode Decomposition for Dynamical Systems
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("James", "Harris", email = "jimeharrisjr@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("The authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = "ctb",
           comment = "see inst/AUTHORS file for details"))
Description: Dynamic Mode Decomposition (DMD) with Koopman operator theory
    extensions, powered by a Rust backend via 'extendr'. Provides standard DMD
    (Schmid, 2010, <doi:10.1017/S0022112010001217>), Extended DMD with lifting
    functions, Hankel-DMD via time-delay embedding, Generalized Laplace Analysis
    for direct eigenfunction computation, harmonic time averages, and mesochronic
    harmonic plots for phase space analysis (Mezic, 2020,
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2009.05883>). Includes built-in area-preserving and chaotic
    maps for experimentation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
